{"id":"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-arith-real-relation.md","title":"带函数变量的算术关系","display":"df-arith-real-relation — 带函数变量的算术关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-arith-real-relation","aliases":["20-df-arith-real-relation"],"display":"df-arith-real-relation — 带函数变量的算术关系","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"本地带函数变量算术语义定义","depends_on":["[[20-df-formula]]","[[20-df-satisfaction]]","[[20-df-pa]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-arith-real-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-arith-real-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arith-real-relation — 带函数变量的算术关系"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"本地带函数变量算术语义定义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{PA,f}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{PA,f}\\)</span> 在算术语言上增加一个一元函数符号 f；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_f=(\\omega,0,S,+,\\times,f)\">\\(\\mathfrak N_f=(\\omega,0,S,+,\\times,f)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arith\\text{-}real\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathscr A_{k,1}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega^\\omega:\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA,f})\\\n[\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n((\\vec n,f)\\in R\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_f\\models\\theta[\\vec n])]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arith\\text{-}real\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathscr A_{k,1}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega^\\omega:\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA,f})\\\n[\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n((\\vec n,f)\\in R\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_f\\models\\theta[\\vec n])]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>公式只含有限个自然数参数和自然数量词，f 是唯一可变无限对象；它不是一个额外任意固定实参数。自由变量仅为已显示的 k 个自然数变量。此签名用于 lightface 有效解析一级，不能以 df-arithmetic 中一元集合族直接代替矩阵关系。</p>\n<p>来源：本地带函数变量算术语义定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"i